Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Apoti-aabo tuntun: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault paroko: message kọkọrọ: key.
>> decrypted := vault tu-paroko: encrypted kọkọrọ: key.

Ijade 
kọ: ['Message:'], ila-tuntun
kọ: message, ila-tuntun
kọ: ['Decrypted:'], ila-tuntun
kọ: decrypted, ila-tuntun.
